<<set $woreout+=2>>
<span style="color: red;">++磨损</span>
<<else>>
当你抓起一件清道夫的衣服时，酸液随着动作流淌下来，滋滋地在你的橡胶手套上留下了烧痕。<br>
<<damageEquipped "双手" 1>>
还好你戴着橡胶手套！
<</if>><br><br>

[[继续工作|carry]]<br>
[[休息一会|洗衣部]]


:: opencleaningmachine [nobr] {"position":"3025,5100","size":"100,100"}
你把你的衣服都塞进了清洗机，添加了清洁剂。<br>
<<if $equippedCloth != null>>
  你把<<print $equippedCloth.name>>放进了这台快速清洗机。<br><br>
  <<tick 20>>
  你的衣服在自动化的清洗下很快就变得干净如新，这确实比排队等候洗衣部的清理快多了。<br>
  <<set $equippedCloth.clothdirty to 0>>
  <<set $equippedCloth.clothworeout to Math.max(0, ($equippedCloth.clothworeout || 0) - 5)>>
  <<set $chaos += 2>>
  <<set $woreout += 0.5>>

  机器很快就把衣服清理干净了，不过反复冲洗造成的泡沫和电流噪音让空气里弥漫着刺鼻的化学味道。<br>
  <span style="color: red;">+混乱 +磨损</span><br><br>
  [[完成|洗衣部]]
<<else>>
  现在你没有穿着需要处理的衣物，这台快速清洗机暂时无法使用。<br>
  [[返回|洗衣部]]
<</if>>

:: 洗衣widget [widget nobr] {"position":"1300,1550","size":"100,100"}
<<widget "sendToLaundry">>
  /* 参数：$args[0] = 要送洗的衣物对象 */
  <<set _cloth to $args[0]>>
  <<if _cloth != null>>
    <<run $laundryQueue.push({
      cloth: _cloth,
      finishTime: $time.totalMinutes + ($laundryMinutes ?? 1440)
    })>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "increaseClothDirty">>
  <<if $equippedCloth != null>>
    <<set _dirtyStep to Number($args[0]) || ($dirtyIncreaseStep ?? 0.5)>>
    <<set $equippedCloth.clothdirty to Math.min(100, ($equippedCloth.clothdirty || 0) + _dirtyStep)>>

    /* 脏污值过高时，衣物会额外损耗一点耐久 */
    <<if $equippedCloth.clothdirty >= ($dirtyDegradeThreshold ?? 60)>>
      <<set _degradeStep to $dirtyDegradeStep ?? 0.2>>
      <<set $equippedCloth.clothworeout to Math.min($equippedCloth.maxworeout, $equippedCloth.clothworeout + _degradeStep)>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "resolveLaundry">>
  <<silently>>
    <<set $laundryFinishedList to []>>

    <<if $laundryQueue.length > 0>>
      <<for _i to $laundryQueue.length - 1; _i >= 0; _i-->>
        <<set _item to $laundryQueue[_i]>>
        <<if $time.totalMinutes >= _item.finishTime>>
          <<set _item.cloth.clothdirty to 0>>
          <<set _item.cloth.clothworeout to Math.max(0, _item.cloth.clothworeout - ($laundryRepairAmount ?? 30))>>
          <<run $wardrobe.push(_item.cloth)>>
          <<run $laundryFinishedList.push(_item.cloth.name)>>
          <<run $laundryQueue.deleteAt(_i)>>
        <</if>>
      <</for>>
    <</if>>
  <</silently>>
<</widget>>